    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、お疲れ！\r\nすっごくいいパフォーマンスだった！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "舞台袖からでもそう思ったんだ\r\n俺も客席から見られたらどんなによかったか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすが灯織だな！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……褒めすぎです",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、完璧なパフォーマンスではありませんでした\r\n上手くいったところもあるけど、満足はしていません",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "歌もダンスもまだまだ改善の余地はあります",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それに……自分に満足してしまったら、\r\nこれ以上何にもなれなくなる気がして……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうところだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……え？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも、もっとやれることがあるって思っている\r\nいつでも最高の自分を届けようとしてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "努力って決して簡単なことじゃないんだ\r\nだから灯織のこと……俺は本当にすごいと思う",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もっと自分のこと褒めていいんだぞ\r\n──まあ、灯織がしなくても、俺が褒めるんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私、そんな評価をいただけるほどじゃありません……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないよ\r\n……灯織は自分を過小評価しすぎるきらいがあるなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『褒めてください』くらい言ってくれると\r\nプロデューサーとしては嬉しいんだけどな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その言い方はずるいです……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040090"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『今日は非の打ちどころがないくらい上手くできた』って\r\nそう思う日が来たら、言うこともあるかもしれません",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私は、誰かに認めてもらったり、褒めてもらいたくて、\r\nアイドルをやってるわけじゃありません",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──でも\r\nプロデューサーは別です",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私が走り始めてからずっと、\r\n一緒に進んでくださっているプロデューサーだから",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーに褒めてもらえると、とても安心するんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織にそう思ってもらえるなら、\r\nプロデューサー冥利に尽きるよ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "頑張っていこう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "灯織はえらいな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺も頑張らないとな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "躓いたり、悩んだり、嫌になったり、\r\n楽しいことと同じくらい、苦しいこともある",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色々あるけど、何もない道なんてないからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まずは、目の前の仕事をしっかりやっていきます",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも完璧な人なんていない\r\n何を思っても、何をしても、灯織は灯織だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、灯織は目指す場所をまっすぐ見ていてくれ\r\n俺はいつだって全力でサポートする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どうかこれからも、よろしくお願いしますね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040200,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんな、小さい子を褒めるみたいな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そういうつもりはないんだけど、\r\n確かにちょっと子ども向けな言い方だったか",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前にも言ったことある気がするんだけどさ、\r\n灯織は自分のことがよくわかってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうでしょうか……\r\n──って、私も同じこと、言ったような気がします",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな！　聞いたかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──だから、人より気付くことも多いんだ\r\nそれってすごいことなんだぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その『気付き』は灯織がもっと活躍していくにあたって、\r\nきっといい方に働くはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えらいとか、すごいとか、褒めすぎです\r\nなんだか恥ずかしくなってきました……",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、嬉しいです\r\nありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いただいた評価が嘘にならないように\r\n頑張りますね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織の頑張りに見合うように、\r\n灯織に置いていかれないように",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "何を言っているんですか、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私がプロデューサーを置いていくなんてありえません",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私は、どんな時でも、数歩だとしても、\r\n絶対、待ってますから……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200904/2002009040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "置いていかれる、は間違いだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織と一緒に歩けるように、俺も頑張るよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002009040280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい……",
